-beauty","skincare","cosmetics","package design","product design","Poster","2023-02-01","### Design Background\nBazzaal Box brings the best of K-Beauty to the world through creator-led curations. Unlike traditional subscription services, Bazzaal operates on a \"drop\" model, requiring a versatile \"one-size-fits-all\" design system that adapts to diverse product lineups for every launch. I designed a packaging identity that ensures a share-worthy unboxing experience while maintaining structural durability for international shipping, regardless of the collection's theme.\n","\u003Cdiv class=\"img-col ar-2-1\">\n  \u003Cimg src=\"/images/posts/260214 bazzaalbox/main-logo-bbox.webp\" />\n\u003C/div>\n\n\u003Cdiv class=\"img-row\">\n  \u003Cdiv class=\"img-col ar-3-4\"> \n    \u003Cimg src=\"/images/posts/260214 bazzaalbox/main3x4.webp\" />\n  \u003C/div>\n  \u003Cdiv class=\"img-col ar-3-4\">\n    \u003Cimg src=\"/images/posts/260214 bazzaalbox/box-model.webp\" />\n  \u003C/div>\n\u003C/div>\n\n\u003Cdiv class=\"my-carousel marquee-mode\" style=\"--marquee-gap: -10px;\">\n  \u003Cdiv class=\"my-carousel-scroll marquee-track\">\n    \u003Cdiv class=\"my-carousel-item\">\n      \u003Cimg src=\"/images/posts/260214 bazzaalbox/bazzaalbox-graphics-marquee1.webp\" class=\"my-carousel-img\" />\n    \u003C/div>\n    \u003Cdiv class=\"my-carousel-item\">\n      \u003Cimg src=\"/images/posts/260214 bazzaalbox/bazzaalbox-graphics-marquee1.webp\" class=\"my-carousel-img\" />\n    \u003C/div>\n  \u003C/div>\n\u003C/div>\n\n\n\u003Cdiv class=\"img-row\">\n  \u003Cdiv class=\"img-col\"> \n    \u003Cimg src=\"/images/posts/260214 bazzaalbox/main1x1-b.png\" />\n  \u003C/div>\n  \u003Cdiv class=\"img-col\">\n    \u003Cimg src=\"/images/posts/260214 bazzaalbox/sub-1b.webp\" />\n  \u003C/div>\n\u003C/div>\n\n\u003Cdiv class=\"img-col ar-3-1\">\n  \u003Cimg src=\"/images/posts/260214 bazzaalbox/boxgrid-hq.webp\" />\n\u003C/div>","src/content/posts/260214 bazzaalbox.md","562661a831821361",{