lybox Launch) and consistent 4%–5% CTRs during key Nov promos, from the previous baseline of 0.1%–0.4%.\u003Cbr>\u003Cbr>\nI established cohesive customer journey by unifying visual identities across E-mail/SNS/Shopify Shopfront, while using generative AI to overcome asset limitations and maximize creative diversity.","\u003Cdiv class=\"my-carousel\">\n  \u003Cdiv class=\"my-carousel-scroll\">\n    \u003Cdiv class=\"my-carousel-item\">\n      \u003Cimg src=\"/images/posts/260331 Mediheal/gif_opt1.gif\" class=\"my-carousel-img\" />\n    \u003C/div>\n        \u003Cdiv class=\"my-carousel-item\">\n      \u003Cimg src=\"/images/posts/260331 Mediheal/gif_opt2.gif\" class=\"my-carousel-img\" />\n    \u003C/div>\n    \u003Cdiv class=\"my-carousel-item\">\n      \u003Cimg src=\"/images/posts/260331 Mediheal/gif_opt3.gif\" class=\"my-carousel-img\" />\n    \u003C/div>\n    \u003Cdiv class=\"my-carousel-item\">\n      \u003Cimg src=\"/images/posts/260331 Mediheal/gif_opt4.gif\" class=\"my-carousel-img\" />\n    \u003C/div>\n    \u003Cdiv class=\"my-carousel-item\">\n      \u003Cimg src=\"/images/posts/260331 Mediheal/gif_opt5.gif\" class=\"my-carousel-img\" />\n    \u003C/div>\n  \u003C/div>\n\u003C/div>\n\n\u003Cdiv class=\"img-col\">\n  \u003Cimg src=\"/images/posts/260331 Mediheal/email_111.webp\" />\n  \u003Cimg src=\"/images/posts/260331 Mediheal/email_222.webp\" />\n  \u003Cimg src=\"/images/posts/260331 Mediheal/email_333.webp\" />\n\u003C/div>","src/content/posts/260331 Mediheal.md","b6fc5bef06b528c2",{"html":168,"metadata":169},"\u003Cdiv class=\"my-carousel\">\n  \u003Cdiv class=\"my-carousel-scroll\">\n    \u003Cdiv class=\"my-carousel-item\">\n      \u003Cimg src=\"/images/posts/260331 Mediheal/gif_opt1.gif\" class=\"my-carousel-img\">\n    \u003C/div>\n        \u003Cdiv class=\"my-carousel-item\">\n      \u003Cimg src=\"/images/posts/260331 Mediheal/gif_opt2.gif\" class=\"my-carousel-img\">\n    \u003C/div>\n    \u003Cdiv class=\"my-carousel-item\">\n      \u003C